WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,670
All ignored

2
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:01,720
No living person can care about himself

3
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:04,000
Who can keep looking at the face of the dead and live? You are right.

4
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,120
Then you have to live longer

5
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:07,400
Your brother is not as good as Hu Mingyu, you?

6
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:35,220
It's definitely not an accident

7
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,140
It's man-made

8
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:38,100
It’s wrong to say that we are all present during the meal

9
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:42,900
As long as Hu Yunjun is not here, don’t talk nonsense without evidence.
